      "writtenOn": "2025-11-17T14:55:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "One thing I just realized in the Unary changes, this `lhs_value` can be a `nullptr`. The fuzzer likes to do this, so you probably need to guard all these and check if `lhs_value` is a nullptr.",
      "revId": "037d0c3312b865b2b9a6ce0ae9c7934dbd663cba",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c7671e55_3c7f6200",
        "filename": "src/tint/lang/core/ir/builder.h",
        "patchSetId": 6
      },
      "lineNbr": 735,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002241
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-11-17T16:49:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The fuzzer shouldn\u0027t be calling the builder methods though, so I don\u0027t think we need to do this here.",
      "parentUuid": "df6d8162_fc1bb991",
      "revId": "037d0c3312b865b2b9a6ce0ae9c7934dbd663cba",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
