      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-11-17T16:54:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For `Unary` we do have test which test for a `nullptr` value, which end up crashing if you try to get the Type. Not sure if the same exists for binary.",
      "parentUuid": "c7671e55_3c7f6200",
      "revId": "037d0c3312b865b2b9a6ce0ae9c7934dbd663cba",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b19196f5_4791204f",
        "filename": "src/tint/lang/core/ir/builder.h",
        "patchSetId": 6
