        "id": 1002241
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-11-17T17:11:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right, but these are builder methods written by us. We could choose to just say that these sorts of tests have to create the instruction directly, to avoid the check in these methods.\n\nBut the overhead is likely small so I don\u0027t feel strongly either way.",
      "parentUuid": "e89ef767_3dd82ee8",
      "revId": "037d0c3312b865b2b9a6ce0ae9c7934dbd663cba",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
