      "writtenOn": "2025-11-18T16:24:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I have added a nullptr check. I wonder if this is actually what we want long term. The idea what we can have null entries passed in. It is much easier in the code if this is simply not allowed. Sometimes null is used as a sentinal for missing value but I dont think that applies to something like these instructions.",
      "parentUuid": "b19196f5_4791204f",
      "revId": "037d0c3312b865b2b9a6ce0ae9c7934dbd663cba",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
