      "writtenOn": "2025-11-18T17:07:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instad of doing the `?:` you could just:\n\n```\nTINT_ASSERT(lhs_value);\nTINT_ASSERT(rhs_value);\n```\n\nwhich removes the ternary and removes the ability to pass a `nullptr` into the api. Passing `nullptr` isn\u0027t part of the API, but the fuzzer will still do it.",
      "parentUuid": "f29e3277_abe2f72f",
